    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that extracts specific fields from a receipt using an external provider. I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a concrete external provider for document text extraction. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Textract client to call the service. The script will be identifiable as using Amazon Textract by the import statement and the client initialization. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864510083,
          "start": 1789864506069
        },
        "type": "text"
